# Contact form (Formspree). Create a form at https://formspree.io and paste
# its form ID here (the part after /f/ in your endpoint, e.g. "xrgkabcd").
# Copy this file to .env.local for local dev, and add the same variable in
# your Vercel project settings (Environment Variables) for production.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
